@page "/pricing"

<PageTitle>Pricing — FitSpiralS</PageTitle>

<div class="fs-pricing-page">
    @* ===== HERO ===== *@
    <div class="fs-pricing-hero fs-animate">
        <h1>Pick your plan. Start today.</h1>
        <p>All plans include a 14-day free trial. No credit card required.</p>
    </div>

    @* ===== PRICING CARDS ===== *@
    <div class="fs-pricing" style="padding-top:0;">
        <div class="fs-pricing-grid">
            <PricingCard TierName="Athlete" Price="20" Delay="1"
                Features="@(["Periodized programs", "RPE autoregulation", "Fatigue modeling", "Basic analytics", "Weight tracking", "Body composition"])" />
            <PricingCard TierName="Competitor" Price="45" Highlighted="true" Delay="2"
                Features="@(["Everything in Athlete", "Advanced analytics & charts", "Training partners", "Shared sessions", "Goal tracking & insights", "CSV/JSON data export"])" />
            <PricingCard TierName="Coach" Price="99" Delay="3"
                Features="@(["Everything in Competitor", "Up to 50 athletes", "Alert engine (6 types)", "Program generation for athletes", "Coach dashboard & notes", "Athlete progress overview"])" />
        </div>
    </div>

    @* ===== FAQ ===== *@
    <section class="fs-faq fs-animate">
        <h2>Questions? Answers.</h2>

        <details>
            <summary>What happens after my 14-day trial?</summary>
            <div class="fs-faq-answer">
                You pick a plan and keep training. If you don't, your data stays safe — we don't delete anything. You just lose access to premium features until you subscribe.
            </div>
        </details>

        <details>
            <summary>Can I switch plans later?</summary>
            <div class="fs-faq-answer">
                Absolutely. Upgrade or downgrade anytime through the billing portal. Changes take effect at your next billing cycle.
            </div>
        </details>

        <details>
            <summary>What periodization models do you support?</summary>
            <div class="fs-faq-answer">
                Linear, undulating, and block periodization. Programs are auto-generated based on your goals, experience level, and available training days.
            </div>
        </details>

        <details>
            <summary>How does the coach platform work?</summary>
            <div class="fs-faq-answer">
                Coaches can invite athletes, monitor their training via dashboards, set up 6 types of automated alerts, generate programs, and add contextual notes — all remotely.
            </div>
        </details>

        <details>
            <summary>Do I need a credit card to start?</summary>
            <div class="fs-faq-answer">
                Nope. 14 days free, no card required. We'll remind you before the trial ends.
            </div>
        </details>
    </section>

    @* ===== FINAL CTA ===== *@
    <section class="fs-cta">
        <h2 class="fs-animate">Still not sure?</h2>
        <p class="fs-animate fs-delay-1">Start free. Cancel anytime. No hard feelings.</p>
        <a href="/register" class="fs-btn-primary fs-animate fs-delay-2">Start Your Free Trial</a>
    </section>
</div>
